    "Your trips stay on this iPhone. Migration prepares your current local data for your signed-in Wanderlust account without deleting local travel records.": {
      "comment": "A description of the account migration process.",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Reisen bleiben auf diesem iPhone.\nDie Übertragung bereitet deine aktuellen lokalen Daten für dein angemeldetes Wanderlust-Konto vor, ohne lokale Reiseaufzeichnungen zu löschen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your trips stay on this iPhone.\nMigration prepares your current local data for your signed-in Wanderlust account without deleting local travel records."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "旅行データはこのiPhoneに残ります。\nアカウント移行では、ローカルの旅行記録を削除せず、現在のデータをログイン中のWanderlustアカウントで使えるように準備します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your trips, cities, flights, passport stamps, statistics, backups, and app preferences remain on this device.": {
